Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Add workout editing, search, and template management
 features

- handlers/__init__.py: Added renaming_workout and changing_workout_description states to general text handler routing logic
- handlers/workouts.py: Implemented edit_composition flow for full structure modification, including loading existing exercises into FSM state
- handlers/workouts.py: Added rename_workout and change_desc_workout callback handlers with corresponding text input processing in process_workout_text_input
- handlers/workouts.py: Updated create_finish to support both new creation and updating of existing workouts based on editing_workout_id context
- handlers/workouts.py: Enhanced _show_block_selection to display dynamic headers and buttons depending on edit vs create mode
- handlers/workouts.py: Improved access control checks in edit_workout to allow admins and authors
